                "text": "<tal:vars define=\"\r\n    applicants_signaletic python: self.getApplicantsSignaletic();\r\n    portion_outs_text python: self.getPortionOutsText();\r\n    work_location_signaletic python: self.getWorkLocationSignaletic();\r\n    licence_subject python: self.getLicenceSubject();\r\n    reference self/reference;\r\n    date_decision python: tool.formatDate(licence.getLastSimpleCollege().getDecisionDate());\r\n    \r\n\">\r\n<p>Vu le d\u00e9cret du 11 mars 1999 relatif au permis d\u2019environnement ;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Consid\u00e9rant que le coll\u00e8ge \u00e0 prit acte du permis en date du <tal:a replace=\"date_decision\"/>;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Que la d\u00e9claration concerne <tal:a replace=\"licence_subject\"/> sur un bien sis <tal:a replace=\"work_location_signaletic\"/> cadastr\u00e9 <tal:a replace=\"portion_outs_text\"/> ; </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Consid\u00e9rant que l'exploitant nous informe de la cessation de son permis ;</p>\r\n\r\n</tal:vars>"
